## Third-party components

**Sprite sheet format** — inherited from FAOSDance (MIT). This is a clean
rewrite rather than a port, but the 8-cell PNG plus `.txt` sidecar layout is
theirs and is credited here (spec §1.3).

**Beat and downbeat tracking** — `beat-this`, a Rust port of the ISMIR 2024
tracker. The ONNX model weights are fetched at packaging time and are covered by
their own upstream licence, not by this one.

**Artwork is not covered by this licence.** No sprite sheet is the author's work
unless stated, and only the plain default sheet is distributed here at all.

The application links to places sheets can be downloaded from, and warns before
opening each one. Those links are pointers, not permission: FL-Chan belongs to
Image-Line, fan-made sheets belong to their creators and often depict characters
owned by someone else again. Each is published on its own terms.

In particular, FL-Chan **must not be redistributed** — it is excluded from this
repository and from every release package (spec §1.3).
